        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, MUKAMA aligorra omukono gwe obwa kabiri, ajune abantu abaasigaireho abaihe Asiriya, Misiri, Patiroosi, Esopiya, Eramu, Sinaasi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu, nubwo aliimukiza amahanga ebendera, nubwo alisorooza Abaisirairi abaararangire, kandi nubwo alisorooza abaararangire ab'oruganda rwa Yuda, abaihe omunsonda ina ez'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukama bwa Isirairi, tibuligaruka kukwatirwa Yuda ihali, kandi na Yuda taligaruka kuba munyanzigwa wa Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu abo bombi baliseesira Abafirisiti aba Bugwaizooba, banyage abantu abaikara Burugaizooba. Balisingura abantu ab'Edomu n'aba Mowabbu, kandi ab'Amooni balibahurra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 16:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA alyomya omukono ogw'enyanja ya Misiri n'omurro ogw'orwoya orw'akanwa ke, agorre omukono gwe ha nyanja agibaganizeemu obwambu musanju ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo abantu bambuke nibarubata hoomere, atemere abantu be omuhanda. Abasigaireho baaruga omu kuzaahisibwa kw'Asiriya, nkooku yagutemiire Abaisirairi obu bakaba nibaruga Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
